  mainEntity: [
    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'I am not chasing Liverpool, Chelsea or United. Which 15:00 English games can I ask for near Sol?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'Brighton vs Brentford and Ipswich Town vs Bournemouth, both 15:00 Europe/Madrid. They sit on Dubliners’ live What’s On board (Espoz y Mina 7, from 12:00). Palace–Liverpool and Sunderland–Chelsea kick off at the same hour; United–Villa is 17:30. Meet at the four sister bars. Ask which screen. We do not claim O’Reilly’s, O’Connell’s or Four Corner show a named match.',
